SUMMARY:Alice's Restaurant
LOCATION:Capitol Theatre\, 204 Massachusetts Ave\, Arlington\, MA 02474
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by Arlo Guthrie’s song “The Alice’s Restaurant M
 assacree\,” Bonnie and Clyde director Arthur Penn (with screenwriting su
